## Lovable Billing Model
Source: https://docs.dodopayments.com/developer-resources/billing-deconstructions/lovable

## Accelerate with the LLM Ingestion Blueprint

The [LLM Ingestion Blueprint](/developer-resources/ingestion-blueprints/llm) wraps your AI client and sends a usage event for every call.

```typescript
import { createLLMTracker } from '@dodopayments/ingestion-blueprints';
import OpenAI from 'openai';

const tracker = createLLMTracker({
  apiKey: process.env.DODO_PAYMENTS_API_KEY,
  environment: 'live_mode',
  eventName: 'ai.message',
});

const trackedClient = tracker.wrap({
  client: new OpenAI(),
  customerId: 'cus_abc123',
});

// Sends one ai.message event; the Count meter above deducts 1 credit per event
await trackedClient.chat.completions.create({
  model: 'gpt-4o',
  messages: [{ role: 'user', content: 'Build a landing page' }],
});
```

> **Tip:**
  Each event also carries `inputTokens`, `outputTokens`, `totalTokens`, and `model` in its metadata. See the [full blueprint documentation](/developer-resources/ingestion-blueprints/llm) for more details on automatic tracking.

